WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.069
More now on Donald Trump's

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:03.937
legal reckoning

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:05.739
and his reprehensible words.

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.007
