00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:07.774
for the weekend.

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.109
The Manhattan D.A.

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.477
brings them back on Monday.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:12.012
But Donald Trump is not waiting.

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.780
A week of attacks on prosecutor

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:14.714
Alvin Bragg

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:16.516
