00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:07.026
nonstop all week long,

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.062
that as a candidate for president,

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:10.463
and as a public figure,

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.465
he can draw people,

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.467
