00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:46.132
He's entitled to do this if he wants.

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:47.100
It's a free country.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.701
But the idea

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:50.870
anyway, anyway, that a former president,

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:51.371
